{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2023-05-31 08:45:00', 'title': "HALLIBURTON LANDMARK DECISIONSPACE® GEOSCIENCES SELECTED AS EQUINOR'S STANDARD SUBSURFACE DATA INTERPRETATION TOOL", 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HALLIBURTON COMPANY (NYSE: HAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED EQUINOR (NYSE: EQNR) SELECTED HALLIBURTON LANDMARK DECISIONSPACE® GEOSCIENCES AS ITS STANDARD GEOSCIENCE TOOLBOX AND OPENWORKS® WITH OPEN SUBSURFACE DATA UNIVERSE (OSDU™) AS ITS CORPORATE DATABASE FOR INTERPRETATIONS FOR ITS SUBSURFACE DATA. EQUINOR'S ONE SUBSURFACE COMMUNITY WILL NOW HAVE A STANDARDIZED SUBSURFACE TOOLKIT, WHICH HELPS THEM TO SEAMLESSLY INTRODUCE GEOSCIENTISTS INTO DIFFERENT PROJECTS. THE SOLUTION WILL C."}